💡 **SUGGESTION (re-flagged on head 7ab6eac249 — not addressed by the rework round): reuse `walletWithChannel` from `test/network/fakes.dart` instead of re-inlining the fixture**

`pumpDialog` in the new narrow-viewport group rebuilds, line by line, what `walletWithChannel({channelPub, channelPriv})` in `test/network/fakes.dart` already does (load `MemoryWalletBackend`, `createIfMissing('Me')`, `addNetwork(net1/fa-team)`, `addChannelKeys(c1)` — the group's variant additionally passes `password:`, which the helper doesn't expose, so either extend the helper with an optional `networkPassword` or keep just that one call site inline). Combining it with the existing `buildManager` helper removes ~10 duplicated lines and keeps the wallet fixture single-sourced:

```dart
final wallet = await walletWithChannel(
  channelPub: channelKeys.pub,
  channelPriv: channelKeys.priv,
);
final manager = await buildManager(wallet: wallet, jwt: 'jwt');
```

The golden test's `_pumpAddAgent` mirrors the same scaffolding too — a shared helper would serve both, but the in-file reuse is the cheap win.

